      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00851",
      "unit_index": 1,
      "source_text": "“不是刚才吗，女佣来添火的时候嘛。”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Wasn't it just now, when the maid came to tend the fire?",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00851",
      "unit_index": 2,
      "source_text": "她想起来又笑个不停。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Remembering it, she could not stop laughing.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00851",
      "unit_index": 3,
      "source_text": "脸刷地红到耳朵根，好像要掩饰过去似地拿起被头一边扇一边说：",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Her face suddenly flushed red all the way to her ears, and as if trying to cover it up, she picked up the edge of the quilt and said while fanning herself:",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00851",
      "unit_index": 4,
      "source_text": "“起床吧。",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "Get up.",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "paragraph_id": "snow-country-zh-p00851",
      "unit_index": 5,
      "source_text": "叫你起床嘛！”",
      "en": [
        {
          "t": "I said, get up!",
          "g": "predicate"
        }
      ]
    }
  ]
}
